//
//  Everything is computed procedurally in the fragment shader (no baking):
//    - Point stars      (hash-based spherical star field, ~100k star look)
//    - Bright stars     (a few additive glow sprites)
//    - Nebulae          (fBm domain-warped 4D classic Perlin noise)
//    - Sun              (white-hot disk + colored flare)
//    - Moon             (ray-traced textured sphere + soft edge + glow)
//
//  All parameters are exposed to the Material Inspector so the skybox can be
//  tweaked live in Unity. The C# generator (SpaceSkyboxGenerator.cs) fills the
//  values deterministically from a seed; feel free to override by hand.
//
//  Works in the Built-in Render Pipeline and URP (custom skybox pass, unlit).
// ============================================================================

Shader "Space3D/Space Skybox"
{
    Properties
